            <title>[IGNITE-20462] Idle_verify prints partitions hash conflicts when entries are expiring concurrently</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-20462</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Background process of entries expire (ttl-cleaner-worker) always working on activated cluster, so, during idle_verify execution entries still can be expired even without workload on cluster. &lt;/p&gt;</description>
